            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(alchemical, poison)\n\nWhen one of Ingnovim's assistants dies, it bursts open in a foul-sounding and smelling explosion of toxic viscera and poisonous vapors.\n\nAll creatures within a 20-foot burst must attempt a DC 38 Fortitude save to resist this blast of poison.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature is sickened 2.\nFailure: The creature takes 7d8 poison damage.\nCritical Failure: The creature takes 14d8 poison damage and 2d8 persistent poison damage."
